# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
"""
MLG-UAF: ViT-B/16 + 6 Longformer layers + 4 MoBA layers + MLP fusion.

Architecture:
  Code: Longformer embeddings -> 6 local-window Transformer layers
        -> 4 MoBA top-k block-attention Transformer layers -> masked mean pool
  Image: pretrained ViT-B/16 -> projection
  Fusion: concatenate 512-D features -> MLP -> 2 classes

Initialization:
  - Longformer-base-4096 pretrained embeddings.
  - Layers 0-5 initialize the six local Longformer layers.
  - Layers 6-9 initialize the four MoBA layers (Q/K/V, output projection,
    FFN and LayerNorm).
  - The remaining Longformer layers are not used.
  - ViT-B/16 uses ImageNet pretrained weights.
  - All model parameters are trainable; no encoder is frozen.

Important:
  This is a new architecture/training implementation. Retrain and reevaluate
  before reporting any results. Do not reuse metrics from the previous model.
"""

